<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Quicksand</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Class: Druid (guild level 31)
Mana: 40
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast quicksand
</pre>
<p>The caster folds their hands and chants 'Liquidus Sub Terra', and the 
ground of the whole room turns to a mire of quicksand. It slows everyone in 
the room but you and your group, making them slower in a fight for a 
while, longer the better the casting. Other players are slowed only if you 
both have signed the Book of Blood. If the spell fails, the ground holds 
firm.
</p><p>It can't be cast indoors, in the desert, on or under water, or on snow, 
slush or ice. You must be standing.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
